* Ternary Adder Full Truth-Table Testbench (5V0 Domain)
* Tests 3 ternary_input states (0V, 2.5V, 5.0V) x 4 (ctrl_over, ctrl_sign) states

* 1. PDK Models (GF180MCU)
.include "$PDK_ROOT/gf180mcuD/libs.tech/ngspice/design.ngspice"
.lib "$PDK_ROOT/gf180mcuD/libs.tech/ngspice/sm141064.ngspice" typical

* 2. Include your Magic-extracted netlist
.include "5v0_addh_sc_v3.spice"

* 3. Subcircuit Instantiation (Uncomment and verify pin order ONLY if your .spice file uses .subckt)
* Xdut ternary_input ctrl_sign ctrl_over ternary_output VDD_3V3 VDD_1V65 VSS 5v0_add_q_sc_v0

* 4. Power Rails (5.0V full rail, 2.5V half rail, 0.0V ground)
Vdd VDD_3V3  0 DC 5.0
Vhf VDD_1V65 0 DC 2.5
Vss VSS      0 DC 0.0

* 5. Stimulus Sources (12 states total, 5ns per state, 100ps transitions)

* Fast axis: ternary_input cycles through 0V -> 2.5V -> 5.0V four times

* Reference Ternary Input (0.0V -> 2.5V -> 5.0V per 15ns cycle)
Vin_0 ternary_input 0 PWL(
* --- Cycle 1: ctrl_over=0, ctrl_sign=0 ---
+  0.0n  0.0   5.0n  0.0
+  5.1n  2.5  10.0n  2.5
+ 10.1n  5.0  15.0n  5.0
* --- Cycle 2: ctrl_over=0, ctrl_sign=1 ---
+ 15.1n  0.0  20.0n  0.0
+ 20.1n  2.5  25.0n  2.5
+ 25.1n  5.0  30.0n  5.0
* --- Cycle 3: ctrl_over=1, ctrl_sign=0 ---
+ 30.1n  0.0  35.0n  0.0
+ 35.1n  2.5  40.0n  2.5
+ 40.1n  5.0  45.0n  5.0
* --- Cycle 4: ctrl_over=1, ctrl_sign=1 ---
+ 45.1n  0.0  50.0n  0.0
+ 50.1n  2.5  55.0n  2.5
+ 55.1n  5.0  60.0n  5.0
+ )

* Medium axis: ctrl_sign toggles every 15ns (0V for 15ns, 5V for 15ns)
Vsign ctrl_sign 0 PWL(
+  0.0n  0.0  15.0n  0.0
+ 15.1n  5.0  30.0n  5.0
+ 30.1n  0.0  45.0n  0.0
+ 45.1n  5.0  60.0n  5.0
+ )

* Slow axis: ctrl_over toggles at 30ns (0V for 30ns, 5V for 30ns)
Vover ctrl_over 0 PWL(
+  0.0n  0.0  30.0n  0.0
+ 30.1n  5.0  60.0n  5.0
+ )


* Output capacitive load
CLoad ternary_output 0 10ff

* 6. Automated Verification Measurements (Samples output at the middle of each 5ns window)
.meas tran out_O0_S0_in0v0 FIND v(ternary_output) AT=2.5n
.meas tran out_O0_S0_in2v5 FIND v(ternary_output) AT=7.5n
.meas tran out_O0_S0_in5v0 FIND v(ternary_output) AT=12.5n

.meas tran out_O0_S1_in0v0 FIND v(ternary_output) AT=17.5n
.meas tran out_O0_S1_in2v5 FIND v(ternary_output) AT=22.5n
.meas tran out_O0_S1_in5v0 FIND v(ternary_output) AT=27.5n

.meas tran out_O1_S0_in0v0 FIND v(ternary_output) AT=32.5n
.meas tran out_O1_S0_in2v5 FIND v(ternary_output) AT=37.5n
.meas tran out_O1_S0_in5v0 FIND v(ternary_output) AT=42.5n

.meas tran out_O1_S1_in0v0 FIND v(ternary_output) AT=47.5n
.meas tran out_O1_S1_in2v5 FIND v(ternary_output) AT=52.5n
.meas tran out_O1_S1_in5v0 FIND v(ternary_output) AT=57.5n

* 7. Simulation & Plotting Commands
.tran 10p 60n
.op

.control
run
* Stacked plot: Output vs Input on Plot 1, Control lines on Plot 2
plot v(ternary_output) v(ternary_input) 
plot v(ternary_input) v(upstepper_test)
plot v(ternary_input) v(downstepper_test)
plot v(ternary_input) v(pti) v(nti)
plot v(ternary_output) v(carry_0_probe) v(carry_sign_probe)
plot v(pti) v(inv_pti) 
plot v(nti) v(inv_nti) 
plot v(ctrl_over) v(ctrl_sign)

plot i(Vss)
.endc

.end